\
**Version:** 2.3\
**Last Updated:** October 26, 2023\
**Effective Date:** January 1, 2024 (Plan Year 2024)\
**Applies To:** All eligible employees of Innovatech Solutions\
**Policy Owner:** People & Culture (P&C) Department\
**Related Policies:** 500 - Benefits & Insurance Policies, 200 - Time Off & Leave Policies (PTO), 700 - Onboarding & Offboarding Procedures\
