\
### 4.2 Dental Plan Notes\
- Two cleanings per calendar year are covered at 100%.\
- Orthodontia is not covered for adults under this plan.\
- Waiting periods may apply for major services if you did not have prior dental coverage. Contact SmileCare for details.\
