## 9.0 Employee Assistance Program (EAP)\
\
The EAP is available to all employees and their household members at no cost. Services include:\
- Confidential counseling (up to 6 sessions per issue, per year)\
- Mental health support\
- Financial and legal consultations\
- Work-life balance resources\
- Crisis intervention\
\
**Contact:** 1-800-555-0199 or `eap@innovatech.example.com`\
